  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos Urban Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (LUWASH) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through LUWASH, USAID/Nigeria seeks to support the Lagos State Water Corporation (LSWC) and Lagos State Water Regulatory Commission (LASWARCO) with targeted technical assistance to support the Lagos Government initiative, minor rehabilitation of electromechanical and laboratory equipment, and needed rehabilitation of existing infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
